OL,3,AKing to address slavery during
OL,4,ACommonwealth speech in Antigua on final
OL,5,Aleg of Caribbean tour
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt is understood the Palace was told in
OL,8,Fadvance of Burnham's comments in an
OL,9,Fopinion piece on Friday night, and the
OL,10,FKing has not made any changes to his
OL,11,Fspeech in light of them.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
