OL,3,AIndia's opposition set to hold mega
OL,4,Arally seeking election chief's
OL,5,Aresignation
OL,6,
OL,7,FSeveral top leaders of the Congress-led
OL,8,FINDIA alliance have said they would
OL,9,Fattend and the influential Gen Z-led
OL,10,Fpressure group Cockroach Janta Party
OL,11,F(CJP) has also pledged support.
OL,13,FThe rally comes amid growing criticism
OL,14,Fof a voter-list revision exercise that
OL,15,Fhas removed 130 million names from the
OL,16,Fdraft rolls across India.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
